:''This stage has no official name.''
'''The Face of God Invasion''' is an [[Invasion Stage]] that appears in {{1c}} [[Ancient Forest Labyrinth]] after clearing all [[Uncanny Legends]] sub-chapters on {{1c}} difficulty as well as [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Eldritch Forces Invasion]]. This [[No Continues]] stage introduces [[Idi:Ne]], and is the first non-event stage to have a [[Base Barrier]].

Upon completion, [[The Face of God]] will be back to normal and [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]] can be upgraded to her [[True Form]] using [[Catfruit#Behemoth Stones|Behemoth Stones]] and XP.

