==Trivia==
*[[Ancient Forest Labyrinth]] shares its map image with [[Laboratory of Relics]] and a couple other sub-chapters, which may be why The Face of God is the stage invaded by [[Idi:Ne]].
**It could also be because [[Elder Flame Doron]] and Idi:Ne both spawn many times throughout [[The Face of God]] and its invasion.
*The Face of God Invasion is the only stage in Ancient Forest Labyrinth to have no enemies that create [[Surge Attack]]s.
*The Face of God Invasion and [[Revival of Origin/Invasion|Revival of Origin Invasion]] are the only [[Uncanny Legends]] stages to have [[Base Barrier]]s.

